// What every function in emit/gen/txt needs before it can be called: the
// node store (init_nodes*, via boot_a) and the emitter's own registries
// (txt_setup). emit/gen/txt/README.md's interface table says txt_setup runs
// "after init_nodes*()", and this is exactly that, with nothing else pulled
// in -- ty_setup, init_frame and the CFG stores are a different lane's
// setups, composed alongside this one with a second `given` where a case
// needs them too.
txt_fixture() {
  boot_a();
  txt_setup();
} return void;
():() then ty_int:(0)
